{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 1, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 8125613230740415181, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "retries 503 with bounded attempts; no retry on other errors\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {"README.md": {"bytes": 96, "mtime": 1792286047.5221384, "sha256": "4b6141730d2c1b7fdbc977c1575d67ebdcde4f155ea0f8014444615df7e2d1cb"}, "weather.py": {"bytes": 899, "mtime": 1792468380.6521058, "sha256": "8a4b54554411419359a52b9ca605a969f1bd880049ade3cf63fe28311c5e84c7"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/213fdca795ed7a3cf6ee62642ea809f074b7a583/omp", "-p", "Add retry with backoff (3 attempts) to `WeatherClient.get` when the server returns 503.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/transcripts/with/trig-omp-netclient/29/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step7-opus-1019-S7C/omp-30/cells/with/trig-omp-netclient/29/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "without", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/16.2.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/213fdca795ed7a3cf6ee62642ea809f074b7a583/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "Smoke test against a local server that returns 503 a configurable number of times.\n`WeatherClient.get` now retries when the server returns 503. It makes at most 3 attempts in total, and the change is in `weather.py`.\n\n- **Backoff:** between attempts it waits `backoff \u00d7 2^attempt` seconds. `backoff` is a new constructor argument that defaults to `0.5`, so the waits are 0.5s and then 1s, for a worst case of about 1.5s plus request time.\n- **What gets retried:** only a 503 from the server. Other HTTP errors are raised right away. Network errors (`URLError`) and timeouts are not retried either.\n- **When retries run out:** if the third attempt also gets a 503, that 503 is raised to the caller as before.\n\nI tested it against a local stub server with `backoff=0.05`:\n\n| Scenario | Result | Requests made |\n|---|---|---|\n| Server works first time | data returned | 1 |\n| 503 twice, then OK | data returned (after 0.15s) | 3 |\n| 503 three times | `HTTPError 503` raised | 3 |\n| One 500 | `HTTPError 500` raised immediately | 1 |\n\nThe retry ignores any `Retry-After` header the server sends, since you didn't ask for that. I didn't add a test file because the repo doesn't have any tests; the table above came from a one-off run.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 6, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 0, "requests_cache_write": 212925, "requests_cost_usd": 1.1018809999999999, "requests_count": 6, "requests_input_uncached": 14, "requests_output": 1860, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-netclient:claude-opus-5-5:trial29", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 117, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-20T03:52:48.898805+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 144.774, "t_checker_s": 2.487, "t_env_setup_s": 0.0, "task": "trig-omp-netclient", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "off", "